>**Raises nation's Funds and Morale at the cost of Supplies.**
=2 Walkthrough
+ Talk to {n:Rasdinice} in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} and choose Offensive Operations from the Campaign Ops menu.
+ You'll be instructed to go to {z:Everbloom Hollow} in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)}. To enter {z:Everbloom Hollow}, talk to the {p:Beastman Ensign|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Beastman_Ensign} at J-7. Make sure your party is near you before you enter.
+ Once inside you will see nine Orcs. Two {m:Orcish Carriers|Orcish Carrier} and seven {m:Orcish Guards|Orcish Guard}. The objective for this mission is to kill all nine Orcs before they reach the end of their route.
++ The Orcish Carriers will book it at as soon as they are engaged, so you'll need to kill them quickly. The best thing to do is sleep them all and then kill the two carriers followed by the other orcs. The Carriers have approximately 2000hp.
++ The seven Orcish Guards are slightly harder, but not by much with approximately 3000hp each.
++ Took aprooximately 9 tier III -ga spells to eliminate the group.
+ Once all nine Orcs are defeated click on the Twilight Aureola to leave. All members will be awarded ~764 EXP (5 stars).
+ Return to {n:Rasdinice} to complete the mission and receive ~2102 {p:Allied Notes} (5 stars).

=2 Notes
* (unknown)

=2 Objective
A report has been received regarding the location of an enemy supply train. You are to travel to Everbloom Hollow via the Vunkerl Inlet, intercept the caravan, and destroy it.
\**Unit Requirements:** 3~6 members
